<item><title><![CDATA[Kevin Smith paid £5 after dropping off his son and another £5 when collecting him]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132834813.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kevin Smith initially paid ten pounds for two airport drop-offs but was unexpectedly hit with two parking fines totaling two hundred pounds. These fines were charged for completing the payment within the drop-off zone. After appealing, APCOA cancelled one fine, but Mr. Smith is still contesting the second and is prepared to pursue it further if needed.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/kevin-smith-paid-5-after-dropping-off-his-son-and-another-5-when-collecting-him-east-midlands-airport-still-sent-two-100-fines/articleshow/132834813.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/kevin-smith-paid-5-after-dropping-off-his-son-and-another-5-when-collecting-him-east-midlands-airport-still-sent-two-100-fines/articleshow/132834813.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T20:55:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132834813,imgsize-863434.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['They'll arrest us at hospitals': PoK protesters risk death over electricity, flour demands]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132835505.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/theyll-arrest-us-at-hospitals-pok-protesters-risk-death-over-electricity-flour-demands/articleshow/132835505.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/theyll-arrest-us-at-hospitals-pok-protesters-risk-death-over-electricity-flour-demands/artic