ne disease, inspired by a family member who died from the condition.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/an-82-year-old-australian-grandfather-and-his-18-year-old-grandson-cycled-5300km-through-deserts-and-headwinds-raising-65000-for-mnd-support/articleshow/132826574.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/an-82-year-old-australian-grandfather-and-his-18-year-old-grandson-cycled-5300km-through-deserts-and-headwinds-raising-65000-for-mnd-support/articleshow/132826574.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T18:26:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132827345,imgsize-129535.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California approved a State Farm insurance settlement after proposed increases reached 52%]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132832010.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[California insurance regulators approved a State Farm settlement, saving policyholders approximately $530 million.  This agreement significantly reduced proposed rate increases for homeowners and renters across the state.  Thousands of policyholders will now receive refunds with ten percent annual interest.  The settlement also imposes new conditions on State Farm regarding policy non-renewals.  A dedicated process was established for Los Angeles wildfire claims disputes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-approved-a-state-farm-insurance-settlement-after-proposed-increases-reached-52-the-deal-is-estimated-to-save-consumers-about-530-million/articleshow/132832010.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-approved-a-state-farm-insurance-settlement-after-proposed-increases-reached-52-the-deal-is-estimated-to-save-consumers-about-530-million/articleshow/132832010.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T18:25:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132832010,imgsize-816491.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Killed her, took bank card, put body in a suitcase': Chilling details of the murder of aid worker who helped refugees in Greece, Afghan building cleaner arrested]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132832321.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/killed-her-took-bank-card-put-body-in-a-suitcase-chilling-details-of-the-murder-of-aid-worker-who-helped-refugees-in-greece-afghan-building-cleaner-arrested/articleshow/132832321.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/killed-her-took-bank-card-put-body-in-a-suitcase-chilling-details-of-the-murder-of-aid-worker-who-helped-refugees-in-greece-afghan-building-cleaner-arrested/articleshow/132832321.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T18:21:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132832475,imgsize-98052.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida Attorney General threatens catholic schools over vaccine mandate policy, says accept exemptions or lose funding]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132831330.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-attorney-general-threatens-catholic-schools-over-vaccine-mandate-policy-says-accept-exemptions-or-lose-funding/articleshow/132831330.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-attorney-general-threatens-catholic-schools-over-vaccine-mandate-policy-says-accept-exemptions-or-lose-funding/articleshow/132831330.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T17:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132831656,imgsize-629851.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Arnold Schwarzenegger: "What is the point of being on this Earth if you…”]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132830839.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The life of Arnold Schwarzenegger is a testament to the importance of challenging limits and embracing one’s uniqueness. By transcending norms in bodybuilding, film, and politics, he achieved greatness. His experience serves as a reminder that originality fuels innovation and self-improvement. While comparing ourselves to others can hinder personal discovery, choosing an authentic path opens new avenues to success and fulfillment.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-arnold-schwarzenegger-what-is-the-point-of-being-on-this-earth-if-you-a-timeless-lesson-on-being-unapologetically-yourself/articleshow/132830839.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-arnold-schwarzenegger-what-is-the-point-of-being-on-this-earth-if-you-a-timeless-lesson-on-being-unapologetically-yourself/articleshow/132830839.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T17:42:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132831087,imgsize-89374.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Woman swept down Kern River found clinging under rock, rescued from rapids]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132830189.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A woman was pulled to safety after falling into California's Kern River. First responders found her partially submerged beneath a rock outcropping near a steep cliff. They used a life jacket and rescue rope to bring her out of the water. The Kern County Sheriff's Office shared dramatic video footage of the successful rescue. Officials warned the public about the river's extreme dangers and the need for caution.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-woman-was-swept-down-the-kern-river-and-found-clinging-beneath-a-rock-rescuers-pulled-her-from-the-rapids/articleshow/132830189.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/california-woman-was-swept-down-the-kern-river-and-found-clinging-beneath-a-rock-rescuers-pulled-her-from-the-rapids/articleshow/132830189.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T17:05:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132830166,imgsize-333188.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Victoria’s 1987 forest experiment surprised researchers 30 years later]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132829410.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a pioneering study within Victoria's mountain ash forests, surprising findings have emerged over extended periods. Intense thinning of trees fostered lush growth and increased diameters in the surviving trees. These enhanced specimens exhibit greater fire resilience and are likely to create hollows for various wildlife. Interestingly, Leadbeater's possums thrived in thinned and acacia zones, absent from untouched areas. This indicates that forest thinning may yield substantial ecological advantages.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1987-victoria-began-an-a26-million-experiment-inside-a-mountain-ash-forest-three-decades-later-the-results-surprised-researchers/articleshow/132829410.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1987-victoria-began-an-a26-million-experiment-inside-a-mountain-ash-forest-three-decades-later-the-results-surprised-researchers/articleshow/132829410.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T16:41:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132829410,imgsize-232543.cms"/></item></channel></rss>